{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35821","headline":"秋日送严湘侍御归京 · 李咸用","name":"秋日送严湘侍御归京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟾影珪圆湖始波，楚人相别恨偏多。\n知君有路昇霄汉，独我无由出薜萝。\n虽道危时难进取，到逢清世又如何。\n谁听甯戚敲牛角，月落星稀一曲歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}